Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.81,0:00:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些从炼狱里跑出来的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像易形者 只是更爱吃人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like shapeshifters only a lot more into eating folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们流出的是黑色的胶状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they bleed black goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛格先生 我相信你肯定认识米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Singer. I believe you know sheriff mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他妈的迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dick frigging Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是他妈的迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is Dick frigging Roman?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃了你 鲍比 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna eat you, Bob. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 给你帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 鲍比 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. Bobby?! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你来了结未完成的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did you come here to finish the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是要伤到你 而是要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not just to hurt you … to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.69,0:00:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你为我们做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks…for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.22,0:00:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:56.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 行动吧 动作迅速点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this. Move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 先说说我们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. What's the plan exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,保命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝市中心走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你去大路包抄 我从小巷跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you take the street. I'll take the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.85,0:01:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们在中间汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈了个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:02:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两天前）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:18.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（金融市场观察 理查德·罗曼企业股指大幅上扬）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一副「该换尿布了」的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that dirty-diaper look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是我打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我是乔迪·米尔斯 吵醒你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's Jody Mills. I wake you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, I mean, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说一件事 貌似跟你们有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I got something that smells like you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在俄州坎顿发现一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}A body turned up in Canton, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地警方想把案子和尸体一起掩埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local P.D.'s trying to bury the story and the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那具尸体有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, so, uh, what's up with the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者失踪的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when it went missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个很普通的研究生\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a perfectly normal grad student.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫查尔斯·德彬\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Charles Durbin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体被发现的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it turned up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.75,0:02:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一具剥掉纱布的木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thing was mummified minus the wrapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,近两三周以来 类似形态的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is actually the second body found like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经是第二具了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the last couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着像是你们在找的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound like a song you boys tap to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, that's, that's um…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们该干的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our kind of number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, question …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏福尔斯（美国中北部）的警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does a sheriff in Sioux Falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能听到俄州（美国南部）案子的风声\N{\fnArial\fs30}get wind of a case in Ohio?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是爱打听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just that nosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们哥俩经历过那么多事情之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, after everything I've been through with you boys and…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}with bobby, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就对类似的事情格外留心\N{\fnArial\fs30}something like this pops up on the wire, it catches my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去查的 谢谢你 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll look into it. Thanks, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有消息给我电话 好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me after, okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是米尔斯警长 她帮我们找了桩活儿干\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Sheriff Mills. She caught us one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得过意不去 咱们也没帮上她的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I feel bad. We didn't get her anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我要说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I'm about to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我更希望你是在看色情卡通片\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I hope you're watching cartoon smut,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为反复看迪克·罗曼那些破烂玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause reading Dick Roman crap over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是自讨苦吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just self-punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫日本动画 是种艺术形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called Anime, and it's an art form.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:54.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄亥俄 坎顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.93,0:04:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子看着不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this looks nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去后面看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check around back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上有个能凑合用的卫生间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's a semi-functioning bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个没有霉味的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one un-rancid bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫能凑合用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define semi-functioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说「地上有个坑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do not use the words "hole in the floor."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,布凭什么就能击败石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does paper beat a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这规则真傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩捉迷藏的孩子发现了那具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids playing hide-and-seek found the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺有图特王（埃及法老）的范儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Very King Tut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 目睹了袭击的目击证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so, this is where the eyewitness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the assault lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但警方觉得他的证词不可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the cops are calling him an unreliable witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:04:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去问问看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史密斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是 史密斯特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh, Special Agent Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有血缘关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No relation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去谈好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈在里面睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom's sleeping in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so, how can I…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你在巷子里目击到的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we, uh … we had a few questions about the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}you witnessed in the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会跟他们一样笑话我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna laugh at my story like the rest of the suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会笑话你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna laugh at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.09,0:05:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我当时在台阶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'm on the steps…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽大麻 然后听到有人打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}medicating… when I hear fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就看了看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的邻居德彬\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my neighbor Durbin,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个打扮得像我爷爷的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some dude dressed like my grandpa's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,掐住了他的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}got him by the neck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫像你的爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you he looks like your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋子时髦 西装革履\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… snappy shoes, suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴一顶贾斯汀·汀布莱克（美国歌手）的那种帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of those, um, Justin Timberlake hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说一种毡帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you mean a … a fedora?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种红色的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}This red, like, energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从德彬传到了帽子男身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}passed through Durbin to hat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我的手表都停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even my watch stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,德比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Durbs…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼看着他变老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He aged before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得皱巴巴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked like a raisin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢警官 两位警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, officer … officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没找到什么能把一个小伙子变成守墓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Nothing that turns a dude into a crypt keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坎顿地区貌似多次出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, greater Canton turns out kind of a hot spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪异的死尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}for weird dead bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 旧闻归档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. News archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但报道时并没说是风干成了木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not exactly reporting, uh, mummifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢 1928年\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still … 1928,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,三名死者貌似自燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}three deaths cited as spontaneous combustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体萎缩 但没有火烧痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodies "Shriveled despite no signs of fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点牵强 不过还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little stretch, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,1974年 发现了三具皮肤萎缩的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}'74, three bodies found with leathery decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,1957年 又有三具尸体严重脱水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, '57, three more … severe dehydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次登了头版\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time one made the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小女孩特里·塞万提斯在教堂附近发现尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl named Terry Cervantes found a corpse near her church.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了地点以外还有什么规律可循吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any pattern here other than the location?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者和作案年份无规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Random vics, random years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过死者似乎成三出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they seem to drop in threes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有两个 还差一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two down, one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let me drive for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你是要找动画片呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you gonna look up more anime,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要直接找迪克呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or are you strictly into Dick now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是内部资料 - 对头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are those local feeds? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么快就找出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克给我开了小灶\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little tutorial from Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们只当没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. We'll pretend this never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.09,0:08:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,干尸二号是在主街附近的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, mummy numero dos was found at the gas n' sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油站发现的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}near main street, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这是加油站周围所有的摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, here's all the cameras around that store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得教我这一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to teach me that trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了 汀布莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check it out … Timberlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能让我多得瑟一会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't let me bask in the glory for one second, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一点儿都没有变老 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't aged a day, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果他几十年来都有露过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, if he's been popping up for decades now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就肯定有人认识他 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}then somebody's bound to know who he is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里有没有可能还住在当地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any chance that, uh, Terry's still local?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,春天的景色非常漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's so pretty in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物复苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我从那条路走回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I walked home that way …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看沿途的花儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.71,0:08:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果看到的是那具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, I found that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至今不明白 到底那人发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have no idea what could have done that to a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recognize that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前和我爸妈住一条街\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he lived on my parents' street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,施耐德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Snider.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸妈具体住在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you say your parents live?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what exactly is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个特别讨人嫌的吸血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sort of vampire who got too sucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据验尸报告 两具尸体内都有血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner's reports said there was blood in both bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百年的血 反正有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}300-year-old blood, but blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙 戴毡帽的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, dude. Uh, fedora dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作迅速点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 先说说我们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. What's the plan here, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,报命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝市中心走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你去大路包抄 我从小巷跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you take the street. I'll take the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们在中间汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈了个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down! Drop the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能不能… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, can I just … - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再说一遍你是从局里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if you tell me you're from the bureau one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就亲自揍扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna air you out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,「没信号」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No signal."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是什么骗子间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you some kind of Jerry spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个水平不高的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a terrible one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个证件的签发日期是六十八年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}This badge was issued 68 years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错啊 德国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace work, Kraut Muncher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:11:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,四四年\N{\fnArial\fs30}'44?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被困在1944年了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck in 1944?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都困在1944年 小杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all stuck in 1944, ya bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先出去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本都不喜欢德国泡菜 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I don't even like frigging sauerkraut, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你能不能省了那套…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can just skip the …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小巷里到底发生什么事了 给我讲清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in the alley? And paint me a real picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我说什么都像疯话 还是说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm "12 monkey'ed" no matter what I say, so here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在追一个家伙 刚看见他把一个人吸成干尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was chasing this dude. Uh, I'd just seen him mummify a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以我突袭了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So, I jumped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发出红光 一下子我们就到了1944年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lights up red. Poof, we're in 1944.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我再说说那红光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more about the red light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的在问我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seriously asking …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是还想出这监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want out of this jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就如实告诉我关于那人的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna tell me everything you can about that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你所谓的红光\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the so-called light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了 然后我们就到这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it, and then we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说…那光环绕着你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say that, uh… it was all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是从那家伙体内放射出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or that more that it came from inside this fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔 鬼魂 异形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons, ghosts, shifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我都杀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I've killed 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你和我是一类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是比我早六十八年 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}just 68 years before me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your name is…?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱略特·尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eliot Ness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.25,0:14:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 怎么了 迪恩哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why? Where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个能把人吸成干尸的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that's been mummifying people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他劫到一个光球里了 然后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}took him in a frigging ball of light and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经常碰到这种情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys get that a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 比常人多些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, more than most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我给你们找的这事 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got you into this, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不是你 你只不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, you didn't. A-all you did was just …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I can help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你愿意搬搬箱子 拉拉货吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um… How do you feel about driving and lifting boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:56.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,我得跟你说 《铁面无私》是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I got to tell you, I mean, "Untouchables" is, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的电影之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of my most favorite movies ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我看了不下五十遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I must have seen that thing, like, 50 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「看过」 你是说我出现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Seen it?" what, like, I'm in the …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你都不知道 你简直太牛逼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah! You don't even know! Oh, you are …!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 咱们慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, hey, wait, wait, wait. Let's just…slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在先说时光旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是在你们那个时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that something you find up a lot of sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经很普及了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the future or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 在我们那个时代这也不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's, uh, not normally on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我跟你一样惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. I'm as surprised as you are that I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们是在追捕同样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're hunting the same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在不同的年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in different centuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿死了两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在一个多月前 中间差了几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few days apart just a little over a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个目击者说她看见那歹徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}One witness said that she saw an assailant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在风干受害者生命之后发出红光\N{\fnArial\fs30}light up red after sucking the life out of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会对此心生敬畏呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that fill you with awe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, this thing, it kills …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一次杀三人 - 一次杀三人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In threes. - in threes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经杀了两人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's two down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在他再杀一个人前抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get this thing before it grabs the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说我现在是个铁面探员了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does…does this mean that I'm an Untouchable now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说我们得去给你换些新衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we got to get you into some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来就跟流浪汉似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like some kind of bindle stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,流 啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stiff your br… bin… what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事 爱略特\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the rumpus, Eliot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是埃兹拉·摩尔 这是迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezra moore. Dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁 乡下人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he? Some farmer clown?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 来自未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天然气四块钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Gas costs four bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷雾罐能挤出奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get cheese out of a spray can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 总理是个黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…the president, he's a black guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能继续往下说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让我开眼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paint me impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计你需要些新衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you need some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来 我来帮你拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let me, uh … let me help you with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去把我车里另外二十箱搬来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go get the other 20 in my truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得鲍比可能有点轻微的囤积症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Bobby may have had a slight hoarding issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点打不开储存柜的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could barely get the door open on that storage locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我很肯定至少有三箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um, I'm pretty sure something's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是有活物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in at least three of those boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「令人敬畏」 你是信教的怪人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Awesome"? You some religious kook?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:18:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他只是喜欢这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he just likes saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说在前头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, spill already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个笨蛋又趟了什么浑水呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bucket of syrup did you two idjits step into?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑吗 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something funny, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我想起了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just kind of remind me of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃兹拉 我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Ezra… we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似我们俩是在猎杀一个时间旅行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems we're hunting a time traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:24.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦犯罪数据库 安全服务器）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.86,0:18:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 他手指上的那个是只戒指吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a … is that a ring on his finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个无垠沙漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Infinite Hourglass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我在他戒指上看到的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the symbol I saw on his ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是时间神的标志 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, that's the mark of Chronos. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The God of Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样的 那些上古之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, with the Old Gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.27,0:19:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前他们 他们还不是天下无敌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}once upon a time they were… they were just short of invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们的魔力大多来自他们的崇拜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they got a lot of their mojo from worshippers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些进贡他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}from people feeding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如今 很少有这种人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These days, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他们没有以前强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, they're not what they used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们用翻倍的怒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they make up for lack of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及亲自动手来弥补了力量的不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}with being twice as pissed and a lot more hands-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这位神为什么要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why's this God killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀人可能是为了恢复能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be he's killing folks for his time juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我到底要怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, how the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他捎我回到2012年呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}am I gonna ride him back to 2012?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以让他抓着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you could let him grab you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意他把你当做汽油用的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't mind him using you for gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么把迪恩带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we get Dean back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么找到这个时间神呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we even find this Chronos?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best stab?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找出一个召唤神的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find a way to summon a God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是先说我们知道事情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's just stick with what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃兹拉 试试看你能否在这堆破东西里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezra, see if you can find something in all this junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出什么是能杀死神的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will kill a God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后过来 看我能弄到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in a few hours, see what I can scrounge up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你们找到他家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you fellas found his house?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看他家现在建成了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go see if it's been built yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.99,0:19:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就杀了那个混蛋 因为这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then let's kill that bastard, because that …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是芝加哥的范儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the Chicago way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「芝加哥的范儿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The chicago way?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会这样讲话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who talks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩·康纳利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean Connery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不要看那部电影了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never watch that movie again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像没人 你带开锁器了吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It looks empty. You got a lock pick? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他哪来的钱能供得起这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he getting all the lettuce to support this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在用「重拳出击」战略\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using the "biff strategy."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间神在赌那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chronos is betting on races.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早已知道结果的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}he already knows the outcome of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在1944年呆的挺长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's spent a lot of time in '44.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.Y.是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's L.Y.?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是东西 是人 叫莱斯特·扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a what. It's a who. Lester Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给镇上的混混们投注\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lays bets for a lot of the flunkies in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去会会他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say we go pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别毁了我的夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Easy with the jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I ain't talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是你的探子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no stoolie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招是跟你学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned it from watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个聪明人 莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you seem like a swell guy, Lester.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想帮你一把 但我的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to help you out. I do, but my partner here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚从战场上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just back from the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's spent the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.63,0:22:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都在痛扁纳粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}kicking in Nazi's skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果几天不揍人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he doesn't kick in a skull every couple days,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.92,0:22:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会手痒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets real touchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特是个德语名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lester. That a German name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.51,0:22:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to snap your cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.61,0:22:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-who you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫施耐德的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fella by the name of Snider.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.81,0:22:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不错过赌局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, bum never missed a bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.41,0:22:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但老让我浑身不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he gave me the heebie-jeebies,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把他踢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I cut him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里付钱给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you meet him for the payoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在早起之鸟 海格提的一个破餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-the early bird! It's a dive on Haggerty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.40,0:22:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他几乎就住在那一带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practically lives in the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.11,0:22:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it - That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你有好消息 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yours sounds better. You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里说人们可以召唤时间神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here that people could summon Chronos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「要求其预言他们的未来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"to compel him to tell them their futures."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了召唤它的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've got the spell to do it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么叫「该死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why the "Damn it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.31,0:23:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤时间神不是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause calling Chronos isn't the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但召唤的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's making sure we summon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩得在他旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Dean is right there…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.95,0:23:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格地说要把手放那家伙身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally with his hands on the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能跟着他一起回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can surf him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是自动就能回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not automatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我们需要找准他们那边的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's more like we need to get the time on their end right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,差一秒都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the exact second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然回来的就是愤怒的大神而不是你哥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we get an angry god but no big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.21,0:23:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我哥就永远困那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's trapped there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,「混蛋 你赢了 享用吧 R」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fine, you ass. You win for once. Enjoy. R."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是「R」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "R"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.75,0:23:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯 家里一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus, a family friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们打的什么赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder what they were betting over?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:23:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 鲁弗斯输得很不甘心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it was, Rufus sure was a sore loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.04,0:24:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺奇怪的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的生活像个拼图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like their life's a big puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是能到处找到它的碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just keep finding pieces of it scattered all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.30,0:24:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该喝了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会希望如此 我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd want us to. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.27,0:24:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喝才没品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be rude not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.76,0:24:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个神来说他有点弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of puny for a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.14,0:24:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你是个正派先生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you were, uh … thought you were Mr. Boy scout.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:25:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我当初是为什么要去追查卡蓬（芝加哥黑手党老大）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I went after Capone in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他藏有芝加哥最好的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy had the best hooch in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.97,0:25:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因为谁的死做了猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now, w-who died in your life and made you a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.46,0:25:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的死 没人挂了 变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who died? Nobody died, you morbid son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.06,0:25:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从事这行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为吸血鬼在克利夫兰转化人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause vampires were turning folks in Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就猎上瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you got the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.73,0:25:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 然后我就上瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I got the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.42,0:25:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我就想用银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you just want to punch through the red tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,崩了官场缛节\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a silver bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎魔让我自由 你难道不是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hunting sets me free. Isn't that why you hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我猎魔是因为家族传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to do it 'cause that's what my family did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.18,0:25:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们还是接二连三的死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they just seem to keep dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.72,0:25:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道做这些事为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I'm doing much of anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:48.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,你打算《泪流成河》吗 娘娘腔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo-hoo. Cry me a river, ya Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.27,0:25:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的猎魔人都像你这样多愁善感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, are all hunters as soft as you in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.03,0:25:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都会失去家人 直到有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody loses everybody. And then one day, boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了 但你至少做了一番贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your number's up, but at least you're making a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.54,0:26:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你还活着享受生活吧 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So enjoy it while it lasts, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为猎魔是你生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause hunting's the only clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.32,0:26:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一丁是丁卯是卯的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna find in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.44,0:26:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你比大多数人要幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that makes you luckier than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.97,0:26:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.27,0:26:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet merciful awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.11,0:27:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有头绪了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everything's coming up us, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.45,0:27:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.57,0:27:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.84,0:27:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,房主莉拉·泰勒小姐 芳龄二十\N{\fnArial\fs30}The owner of the house, Miss Lila Taylor, age 20,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.09,0:27:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人住\N{\fnArial\fs30}lives alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.15,0:27:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车去找埃兹拉 看看她查到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the car, head back to Ezra, see what she's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.15,0:27:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.81,0:27:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续监视这对小夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep my peepers on the sheik and the sheba.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.16,0:28:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.03,0:28:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是维斯太贞女用千年的橄榄树枝雕刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a 1, 000-year-old olive carved by vestal virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.80,0:28:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,并浸蘸了你不会想知道的某种血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dipped in the blood of … you don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.78,0:28:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到这个可不是容易的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulling this together wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.49,0:28:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和尼斯都欠我个人情 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Ness both owe me, smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.48,0:28:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们抓到那家伙你就可以得到你想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have whatever you want soon as we gank this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.27,0:28:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊是啊 带上你的嫩枝 聪明蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Take your twig, wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.53,0:28:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 这个怎么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, how's it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要将这头刺入他的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stick this end in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.18,0:28:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没中 你就变成他的晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, he has you for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.90,0:28:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.97,0:28:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, if I …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我杀了时间神 我就被困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I kill chronos… I'm stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.37,0:28:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才意识到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just now realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.36,0:28:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,1944年没那么糟糕啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. 1944 ain't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我可以冲去欧洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I could head over to Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.05,0:28:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,打断希特勒的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}punch Hitler in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.69,0:29:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,消磨时光的方法太多了 小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's lots of ways to pass the time, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.96,0:29:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.71,0:29:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:29.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《回到未来3》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Back to the future iii."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.90,0:29:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要借张纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to borrow some paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.59,0:29:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 你是尼斯先生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ness I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.09,0:29:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我之前去警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I stopped by the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.20,0:29:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想了结跟着我过来的那个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take care of that hunter who rode me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.20,0:29:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你把他从监狱里放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you took him out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.59,0:29:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想我也许能再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I might see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.87,0:30:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.91,0:30:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.60,0:30:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜 没带垃圾怎么能倒垃圾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take the trash out without the trash, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道脑子丢在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where I left my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我希望你收拾一下行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, I want you to pack a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.53,0:30:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.80,0:31:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直问我我去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're always asking me where I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.80,0:31:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚和我一起走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.76,0:31:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没出什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is…is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.16,0:31:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 一切都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everything's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.42,0:31:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.71,0:31:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶紧收拾行李吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to pack a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.88,0:31:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在路上告诉你原因的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll explain why on the way, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.52,0:31:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是餐馆… - 别管他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the diner… - Forget about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天给他们打电话 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll call them tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go. Pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.23,0:31:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.13,0:31:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.28,0:31:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生 我是特别探员寇斯纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. I am, uh, special agent Costner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.60,0:32:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是国家白蚁防治部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the, uh, department of homeland termite invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.05,0:32:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 白蚁 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Termites? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,本区域爆发了白蚁灾害\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been an outbreak all over this area,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.33,0:32:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我需要检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I just want to do an inspection,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保这一带的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure that the, uh, perimeter's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.01,0:32:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 好啊 请进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, of course. Um, you'd better come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.37,0:32:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.52,0:32:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没什么问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.86,0:32:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.15,0:32:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah … no!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.18,0:32:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.01,0:32:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 因为我正要帮你安装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry, because I'm going to install something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.44,0:32:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,能永远保护这屋子的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will protect this house forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.78,0:32:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.35,0:33:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你累坏了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.31,0:33:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继续跟进 你去休息一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep pushing. You go get some shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.59,0:33:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that's okay. I can, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.31,0:33:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我搬出妈妈的威严吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to use my mom voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.50,0:33:49.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.98,0:34:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.23,0:34:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.12,0:34:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「小萨姆 事实证明施耐德就是时间神」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sammy, turns out Snider is chronos."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.99,0:34:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 这是迪恩写的 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, this is from Dean? How …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.19,0:34:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just read.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.49,0:34:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我跟着他回到了1944年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I rode him to 1944.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.79,0:34:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,和爱略特·尼斯一起 没错 就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am working with Eliot Ness … yes, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.42,0:34:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了时间神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracked down chronos.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.56,0:34:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正和一个名叫莉拉·泰勒的妞交往\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's banging some chick named Lila Taylor,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.11,0:34:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we got a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.35,0:34:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去追捕他 萨姆 你保重「\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going after him. Take care of yourself, Sam."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看信首 - 1944年11月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at the top. - November 5, '44.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.47,0:34:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在我们知道了迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now we know the exact date.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.85,0:34:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住时间神的确切日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean had hands on chronos.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.61,0:34:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只需要知道确切的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need is the exact time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.78,0:34:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么才能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we get how?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.02,0:34:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望 我们能问问当时在场的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoping, we ask someone who was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.37,0:34:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉拉·泰勒小姐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Lila Taylor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.70,0:34:56.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,你能给我调出《小城名流》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, can you get "The Sullivan Show"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.03,0:34:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看弗兰基·瓦力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to watch that Frankie Valli.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.08,0:35:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, actually, we're with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.66,0:35:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克尔又闯祸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Michael in trouble again?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.57,0:35:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就叫他别看那些漫画书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him not to read those comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.66,0:35:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 他…他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, no, no, no. He's, uh … he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.02,0:35:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来是想问问这个人的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd wanted to ask you some questions about this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.69,0:35:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.98,0:35:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得上一次见他是什么时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember the last time you saw Ethan?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.97,0:35:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.60,0:35:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,1944年11月\N{\fnArial\fs30}November 1944 …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.17,0:35:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,时钟停止摆动的那个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the night the clocks stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,时钟停止摆动了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Th-the clocks stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.93,0:35:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,11点34分 屋里的所有时钟无一例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}11:34. Every clock in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.68,0:35:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你还记得什么其他情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, can you tell us anything else you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.99,0:35:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.95,0:35:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了些不堪入耳的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}said awful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.18,0:35:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.49,0:35:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他掐死了那个可怜的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he strangled that poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.40,0:35:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么可怜的小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What poor man?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.08,0:36:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个警察过来想要逮捕伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two policemen came to arrest Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.99,0:36:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 这个人是不是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, was this one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.96,0:36:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森把这人活活的掐死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan choked the life out of that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.15,0:36:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ness!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.65,0:36:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ness!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.42,0:37:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.45,0:37:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.01,0:38:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个砸碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, break this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.12,0:38:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.23,0:38:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 伊森 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Ethan. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.29,0:38:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉拉 抱歉 但你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lila, I'm sorry, but, you just …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.77,0:38:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你说过的每句话都是真心实意的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I said to you is true…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许只是省略了一些细枝末节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he might have left out a few details.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 他是个能穿越时空的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tells you he's a monster who jumps through time?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.91,0:38:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.17,0:38:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.49,0:38:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I'm the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.18,0:38:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这小子太健忘了吧 说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't forget to tell her about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.00,0:38:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这一路走来杀了多少人吧 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- all the people you murdered along the way, Boy Scout. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.76,0:38:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.69,0:38:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了你才这么做 莉拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do it for you, Lila.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.54,0:38:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.34,0:38:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的力量每况愈下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not as strong as he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.41,0:38:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是吗 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Ethan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了获取能力必须吸干他人的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you got to grew up and suck people dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妨让我猜猜 三次杀戮能让你原地复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wild guess … it takes three kills to juice you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.13,0:38:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.51,0:39:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three sacrifices,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.55,0:39:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我控制穿越的时间和地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can control when and where I land.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.50,0:39:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我到了一地 总是不能久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once I get there, it's never for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快又被抛到另一个时间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I'm tossed through time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.41,0:39:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的生活 莉拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my life, Lila.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.68,0:39:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所要的不过是回到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I want is to get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.63,0:39:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你爱上了坎顿的清新空气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you just love the clean Canton air?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.80,0:39:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.39,0:39:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的生活如炼狱一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I lived the worst existence you can imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.30,0:39:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到遇见了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.45,0:39:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你杀害了泰勒·克罗斯比\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you killed Tyler Crosby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.27,0:39:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和凯茜·波特之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Cathy Porter?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.06,0:39:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉拉原本即将成为第三位受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lila here was gonna be victim No.3.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.62,0:39:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.53,0:39:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 别装作一副遇到她之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't act like you never killed a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.22,0:39:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像从未杀过人的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you met her, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.52,0:39:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得过去你为了换个风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me you used to kill three saps.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.87,0:39:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会对三条人命下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}just for a change of scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.47,0:39:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.96,0:39:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我过去漫无目的地游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I used to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.80,0:39:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我有你为伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.29,0:39:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Cathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.02,0:39:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以前每天都来餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to come into the diner every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.42,0:39:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉拉 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lila, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.63,0:39:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.16,0:39:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 莉拉 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lila, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.81,0:39:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:39:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.46,0:40:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.16,0:40:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁面探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, untouchable!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.03,0:40:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.26,0:40:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.85,0:40:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋 毁了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Destroyed everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.80,0:40:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chronos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.07,0:40:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这点本事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that the best you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道你的未来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know your future?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.21,0:40:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.45,0:41:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一片黑色浓胶状物覆盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's covered in thick black ooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.83,0:41:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,遍地都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.99,0:41:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.68,0:41:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们喜欢被淹没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy oblivion.
